+ *          'i': the parameter is i32 type
+ *          'I': the parameter is i64 type
+ *          'f': the parameter is f32 type
+ *          'F': the parameter is f64 type
+ *          'r': the parameter is externref type, it should be a uintptr_t
+ *               in host
