+                     * the later opcode may consume incorrect operand offset.
+                     * Spec case:
+                     *   (func (export "params-id") (param i32) (result i32)
+                     *       (i32.const 1)
+                     *       (i32.const 2)
+                     *       (if (param i32 i32) (result i32 i32) (local.get 0)
+                     *       (then)) (i32.add)
